  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/bsnl-senior-executive-trainee-set-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)</a> </span>has released a notification for the post of Junior Telecom Officer JTO (Telecom). A total of 100 posts have been announced under this recruitment. The online application process for BSNL Junior Telecom Officer JTO Recruitment 2026 has started on 04 June 2026, and candidates can apply until 03 July 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for BSNL Junior Telecom Officer JTO Recruitment 2026 given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BSNL Junior Telecom Officer JTO Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. BSNLCO-14/12(11)/1/2026-RECTT-CO</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>27 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>04